WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.024 --> 00:00:06.850
The Carters were babysitting Martha again.

2
00:00:06.851 --> 00:00:09.690
Rover wanted to help.

3
00:00:09.691 --> 00:00:12.795
"You can't help," Emmy said.

4
00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:16.389
"Dogs don't babysit."

5
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:20.233
Rover looked very sad.

6
00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:23.902
Baby Martha was playing on the floor.

7
00:00:23.903 --> 00:00:28.451
Rover tried to sit next to her.

8
00:00:28.452 --> 00:00:32.408
"Not there!" Harry said.

9
00:00:32.409 --> 00:00:35.985
Rover moved across the room.

10
00:00:35.986 --> 00:00:40.918
He sat on the rug and watched Martha.

11
00:00:40.919 --> 00:00:43.839
She dropped her teddy bear.

12
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:48.701
Rover rushed to pick it up.

13
00:00:48.702 --> 00:00:52.369
"Stop, Rover!" Emmy said.

14
00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:56.583
She grabbed Martha's teddy bear.

15
00:00:56.584 --> 00:01:00.889
"Rover needs some rules," Mom said.

16
00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:05.227
"Don't chew Martha's toys," Emmy said.

17
00:01:05.228 --> 00:01:08.793
"You will make her cry."

18
00:01:08.794 --> 00:01:13.568
"Don't bark at Baby Martha," Oliver said.

19
00:01:13.569 --> 00:01:17.598
"You will scare her."

20
00:01:17.599 --> 00:01:21.792
"Don't jump on the baby," Harry said.

21
00:01:21.793 --> 00:01:24.614
"You will hurt her."

22
00:01:24.615 --> 00:01:30.035
Rover did not chew or bark or jump.

23
00:01:30.036 --> 00:01:35.242
He sat on the rug and looked sad.

24
00:01:35.243 --> 00:01:40.678
Later Harry found one of Martha's books.

25
00:01:40.679 --> 00:01:44.725
There were many teeth marks on the cover!

26
00:01:44.726 --> 00:01:46.776
"Rover chewed this book.

27
00:01:46.777 --> 00:01:50.093
Bad dog!" Harry said.

28
00:01:50.094 --> 00:01:55.362
Rover looked very sad.

29
00:01:55.363 --> 00:01:58.822
"Wait a minute," Emmy said.

30
00:01:58.823 --> 00:02:02.857
"Look at Baby Martha!"

31
00:02:02.858 --> 00:02:08.591
The baby was chewing on another book.

32
00:02:08.592 --> 00:02:10.673
"Rover doesn't chew books.

33
00:02:10.674 --> 00:02:17.784
Martha does!" Emmy said.

34
00:02:17.785 --> 00:02:21.339
Rover barked loudly.

35
00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:24.724
He jumped on Emmy and gave her a big kiss.

36
00:02:24.725 --> 00:02:33.060
Emmy laughed. "Good dog, Rover!"

